  "reviews": [
    {
      "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request correctly addresses a potential issue in multimodal evaluation where samples with the same text prompt but different images could be grouped together, leading to inaccurate metrics. By introducing a unique ID (`uid`) for each sample during validation and using this `uid` for grouping, the change ensures that each unique sample is evaluated independently. The implementation is clean, localized to the validation logic, and aligns well with the problem description. The code changes appear correct and robust.",
